    },
    "Aliens have discovered Earth and want to experience life as humans, **but they have no idea how humans do things.**" : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph of text describing the aliens' situation.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para alien telah menemukan Bumi dan ingin merasakan kehidupan sebagai manusia, **namun mereka sama sekali tidak tahu bagaimana manusia melakukan sesuatu.**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An alien needs your help understanding how to be humans" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the task of the second phase of the game.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seorang alien membutuhkan bantuanmu untuk memahami bagaimana menjadi manusia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Answer their question as clearly as you can." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to answer an alien's question.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jawab pertanyaan mereka sejelas mungkin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask a Human" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanyakan Manusia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask a human:" : {
      "comment" : "A heading for a screen where the user can ask a human.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanyakan pada manusia:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beware: alien knows nothing about humans and might take everything you say literally." : {
      "comment" : "A warning displayed in the transition screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hati-hati: alien ini tidak tahu apa-apa tentang manusia, dan mungkin akan mengikuti semua instruksimu secara harfiah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "But first, you need to know how humans do things." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the purpose of the screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tapi pertama-tama, kalian perlu tahu bagaimana manusia melakukan berbagai hal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
